<li><p class='igt' id='i30'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/4__Nil-treth_Veghaye/mp3/31.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i30w'><span class="word" id="i30w0">Yitoyigg</span><span class="word" id="i30w1">ngiyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i30w2">yix</span><span class="word" id="i30w3">xits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i30w4">xidon'idiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i30g'><span class="gloss" id="i30g0">right away</span><span class="gloss" id="i30g1">inside</span><span class="gloss" id="i30g2">house</span><span class="gloss" id="i30g3">to</span><span class="gloss" id="i30g4">she went back inside</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i30ft'>'Right away she went back into the house.'</span></p></li>
